  "pli-tv-bu-vb-pc26:2.1.15": "“A lot” renders <i lang='pi' translate='no'>bahukaṁ</i>. Sp 2.176: <i lang='pi' translate='no'>Bahukampi sibbatīti sacepi sabbaṁ sūcikammaṁ pariyosāpetvā cīvaraṁ niṭṭhāpeti, ekameva pācittiyaṁ</i>, “<i lang='pi' translate='no'>Bahukampi sibbati</i>: even if he finishes the robe after completing all the needle work, there is just one offense entailing confession.” ",
